{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "853e7e8bc9f886de142655eb28ac840381cfd4d58b1b5cafed6c8aadda31f22f", "ja": "そうそう、そうなんだよつむりん！　茜ちゃんてば、\nどこでも頼りにされちゃうんだよね～。", "zh": "对对，就是这样嘛，小紬！小茜啊，走到哪儿都会被人依赖呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "91ad4d14ce465a7a14ddab97448f8e4f376ba18e97825f4e57d88848d1752c56", "ja": "そうですね。私も、野々原さんには\n何かとお世話になっていますし。", "zh": "是啊。我也经常受到野野原小姐的照顾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "1b9f4537ce1828b2a2b77604be38ab8ef71b868f82be6c4660ccbecb509b4220", "ja": "紬はマジメだな～。けど、茜が実行委員長の\n学園祭かぁ……ちょっと行ってみたいかも？", "zh": "䌷真是认真啊～不过，茜当执行委员长的学园祭吗……我也有点想去看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1003_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "85275098ed36cf7983543fb0308c00c68f0e4978b76ba43f2da2aebf3e659c36", "ja": "ちょっと～、めぐちん！　茜ちんとつむりんも、\n亜美抜きで楽しそうな話とか、ズルいっしょ！", "zh": "真是的～惠惠！茜茜和紬紬也一样，背着亚美聊那么开心的话题，太狡猾了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "d15bd89ae7e1810e132892d5b065ee4b69930a999d6f66232762e6c5dea0bc06", "ja": "あ、やっほ！　亜美……と、歩も！　もしかして\nふたりとも、{$P$}に呼ばれた？", "zh": "啊，你好！亚美……还有步！难道你们俩也是被{$P$}叫来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "76959f6454a4d3ea3569a9fe6e303e74b2148c2761d938911665787a583f5205", "ja": "うん、次の公演の打ち合わせだって。\nそれで、{$P$}はまだなの？", "zh": "嗯，说是要商量下一场公演的事。\n对了，{$P$}还没来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d78c4d83d1b3451e4a583c9d5c05359b0576b365bd8647f45f9d41376ab12a3c", "ja": "ええ。時間も時間ですし、\nそろそろ姿を見せる頃ではないかと。", "zh": "是的，时间也不早了，我想他也差不多该露面了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "22c01e0754ca24529926e91341f9be9b284d17fa7af0406456247e5c70ee1347", "ja": "それより、茜ちんの学園祭の話だよ、つむりん！\n亜美も行きたーい！", "zh": "比起那个，现在说的是小茜学园祭的事啦，小紬！亚美也想去——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bd875f654eea8d949a0780d063cc20cb2b749c21816829743a4d26679334a93a", "ja": "高校の学園祭かぁ……なんか、懐かしい感じがするな。\nやっぱ、クラスの出し物とか、ステージとかあるの？", "zh": "高中校园祭啊……总觉得有点怀念呢。果然会有班级的活动和舞台之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "cce570265632b46e57dd313b4f01d87da8628cfacb1877b644dbffe4c7aab10f", "ja": "もちろん！　クラス以外にも部活ごとの出し物とか\nあるから、スケジュール調整が大変なんだよね～。", "zh": "当然啦！除了班级活动以外，还有各个社团的项目，\n所以调整日程可是超级伤脑筋的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "11e2c1bfdfb000d042a225fbe6c53ef99c06a0fdceffe0542566f04b9fb6cdb6", "ja": "そういった出し物などは、\nアイドルとして、勉強になりそうですね。", "zh": "像这类节目，作为偶像来说，应该也能学到不少东西呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "66580b67617dd1dd72a1b89ea03629abf22d1df1106b0594905d398d9be03577", "ja": "いいよいいよ、みんなおいでよ！　ご招待するよ！\n学園祭実行委員長の、野々原茜ちゃんがね！", "zh": "好呀好呀，大家都来吧！茜来招待你们！\n就由学园祭执行委员长，野々原小茜来招待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "1fd25f2671c77b97de967b938f28d6f8a7b33e315727db23601da9ca41b436e5", "ja": "茜ちん、太っ腹！\nそしたら亜美たちで、学園祭ジャックだー！", "zh": "茜茜真大方！\n那我们就把学园祭给占领啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "12fa60a7149d4732a66d1ccaaa097f9a1f5602c0f4caf68167c044dccfca1426", "ja": "イェーイ！", "zh": "耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1015_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3af80e22ed66a410565135f64817dba027c7e855285e1eec34ee1d5776cab2c8", "ja": "みんな、もう集まってたんだな。\nお疲れさま！", "zh": "大家已经都到齐了啊。\n辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "9ffe29633a7e29be6c2aeffccb11442ddeba8598a98a9b8f400a74f0518dc097", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、遅いよ！　茜ちゃん、\n今超絶忙しいんだから。オファーは早いもの勝ちだよ？", "zh": "{$P$}，太慢了啦！小茜现在可是超绝大忙人，通告可是先到先得的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "248226264043b4ec06591855fa1c903b4b0b6e7d53b8027bca498ad6a786e89a", "ja": "このタイミングで現れるとは……もしや貴方は、\n隠れて私たちの様子をうかがっていたのでは……？", "zh": "偏偏在这个时候出现……难不成，您一直躲在暗处窥探我们的情况……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1e33d37b9822a488a1d73f38ffa8d93d7882e7f3bf7ccc862e8490940b90bdc3", "ja": "いや、そんな事はしてないけど……とにかく、待たせて\nすまなかった。それで、茜は何がそんなに忙しいんだ？", "zh": "不，我可没干那种事……总之，让你们久等了，\n抱歉。话说回来，茜到底在忙些什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "3970e684f560743bf844b6dcdcfdb4140af4da59f514edc3d0214f335cee4280", "ja": "茜、学園祭の実行委員長になったんだってさ。\nすごくない？　委員長だよ、委員長。", "zh": "茜当上学园祭执行委员长了呢。厉害吧？是委员长哦，委员长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "a8235594e329f7687b2b27debed8ebf003b703f2cd489fce791903e94ecebb14", "ja": "頭が高いよ、兄ちゃん！　早くイインチョー様に、\nワイロのプリンを捧げないと！　あと亜美たちにも！", "zh": "兄长，放肆！还不快把贿赂布丁献给委员长大人！还有我们的份！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1022_p", "source_sha256": "6019ae473cee35041dc1390766062ac63f8e4248eb5f66ad95e6202623a72002", "ja": "なんで賄賂がいるんだ……しかし、うーん、そうか。\n学校行事で忙しいなら、茜の新曲公演は次にしようか？", "zh": "为什么需要贿赂啊……不过，嗯，这样啊。  \n既然你因为学校活动很忙，那茜的新歌公演要不要下次再办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "a60d1b7bfe4e1a89cb1caeea238617ca68ea4c0da3661b419efb38813ce7faae", "ja": "ギニャッ！？　何言ってるの{$P$}\nちゃん！　忙しいけど、茜ちゃんはヨユーだってば！", "zh": "嘎呀！？你在说什么啊，{$P$}！忙是忙，不过小茜完全没问题啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "7f2a831b469e83cbb9bf2d87f73c040793670d65e5944f8b09e3f66fcf67adad", "ja": "茜ちゃんなら絶対大丈夫だから！　次は茜ちゃんの\n新曲でお願い、{$P$}ちゃんっ！", "zh": "有小茜在就绝对没问题！下次就拜托唱小茜的新歌了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1025_p", "source_sha256": "57eb0cca8d4bfaec474ed4d32abc750caa56347cb03e7da13eee175826896763", "ja": "もちろん、茜がいいなら構わないけど。\nその代わり、無理そうな時は早めに相談するように！", "zh": "当然没问题，只要茜觉得可以就行。\n不过相对地，觉得勉强的时候要早点跟我商量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e1fd658de587a4b2a6d2b0d9b95ebc566aa8a4ff9b531695ae6d70d73f5e163d", "ja": "茜、メチャクチャやる気じゃん。\nそれなら、アタシたちも気合い入れないとな！", "zh": "茜也太有干劲了吧。那我们也得打起精神来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1028_011ami", "source_sha256": "c664e31628c1df69e1423c760ab38c3988021a5cea97e40593b28a00f877323b", "ja": "亜美もフォローするかんね！　そのかわり……\n学園祭の方は頼みましたぜ？　イインチョー様！", "zh": "亚美也会帮忙的！不过作为交换……\n学园祭那边就拜托你啦，委员长大人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "91b95326c0b1a6d2de21a8481e6d0b092cc76339a56591e99bbd29e730caac92", "ja": "オッケー！　取引成立だね、亜美ちゃん。\n大丈夫、委員長に任せておけばバッチリだからね！", "zh": "好嘞！交易达成，亚美。\n放心吧，交给委员长就万无一失啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "de3116e61e9cda5ba2578f8eb39988845a0518a01349aa282db6a23f0bc2c0eb", "ja": "……。\nクックック……♪", "zh": "……\n呵呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1031_p", "source_sha256": "75b486d545efedfaf52dff04fd995385841d624d78f021ea254ff9e69b357d9b", "ja": "（ん？　茜の様子が何だか……まぁいいか。\nとにかく、今は様子を見る事にしよう）", "zh": "（嗯？茜的样子总觉得有点……算了。总之，现在还是先观察一下吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1032_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1033_joshiseitoa", "source_sha256": "e471db0457e4b3f5ffc0348f34cc124d593dedfaf18b9bec8a92d83c8e8c8e85", "ja": "実行委員長さーん。\n2組のメイド喫茶の予算、持ってきたよ。", "zh": "执行委员长——\n我把2班女仆咖啡厅的预算拿过来了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "d9be6246307af8e6c60df69381c306638e3a2eba113f65dbc825563205ce84a8", "ja": "はいはい、ありがとー！\nまとめてチェックするから、そこ置いといてね～。", "zh": "好啦好啦，谢谢你——！\n我会一起检查的，先放那儿吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1035_danshiseitoa", "source_sha256": "45e26592d165331a1e83704b40476063b943f4a0793f2973c52dc9839f47d866", "ja": "おーい、野々原～！\nステージで使う機材って、今どんな感じ？", "zh": "喂，野野原～！\n舞台上要用的设备，现在情况怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1036_023aka", "source_sha256": "92d518cf5d52389982715397c3f30fa735b8fd29a5c33fc553442019522b15cb", "ja": "ちゃんと申し込んであるから、安心していいよ！\nリハーサルまでには用意できるはず。ガンバレ！", "zh": "都已经好好申请过了，放心吧！\n在彩排之前应该能准备好。加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1037_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "7d5aecd6cdbd0878b7f54c2be289c299a24ca80ae8475e75a6b90c043c7cc5e0", "ja": "の、野々原さん、大丈夫？", "zh": "野、野野原小姐，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "22c4781cad2ec5d416fd0ae023d396bc384524305657bbe80df4b070f0485e2c", "ja": "平気平気！　この程度の仕事を積まれたくらいで、\n潰れる茜ちゃんではないのだ～！", "zh": "没事没事！这点程度的工作量，\n可压不垮小茜哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1039_joshiseitob", "source_sha256": "d48012c020327b70f9d0232ae09dea7289684bab50bb5785766c7070f112a578", "ja": "野々原さん！", "zh": "茜小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1040_danshiseitob", "source_sha256": "524fdfc51ee5acbfa4abf4ed6b55ef625721e8550ded720513d141db027ab2e0", "ja": "実行委員長さん！", "zh": "执行委员长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1041_students", "source_sha256": "ec36644f1cab7c990bbbfcc21b15ed064d67a76b43e0ef21635a34e283455fed", "ja": "ちょっとこっち来てっ！", "zh": "快过来一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1042_023aka", "source_sha256": "2c10a79781abdc5c8ae0a94fc1b2d8d4c875765c9c1b890eab1ea659495814de", "ja": "は、はいはーい！", "zh": "来、来啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1044_023aka", "source_sha256": "207e918a795957eb9e1f47a11fb19586654f04996a23a91ce6c8ef7eece99c1e", "ja": "ふぇ……やっと休憩だよ……。猫の手も\n借りたいって、こういうコトを言うんだニャー……。", "zh": "呃……终于能休息了……。“忙得连猫爪都想借来用”，说的就是这种情况吧，喵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1045_023aka", "source_sha256": "dc2881be0be6697edb555f32799bc953aceb42c9eef0245c4d129172e29c626a", "ja": "あっ、でも茜ちゃんの手は今はいっぱいだから、\nこれ以上は貸してあげられないけどね！　ニャハ……。", "zh": "啊，不过小茜现在也是忙得不可开交，没法再帮更多忙了！喵哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1046_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "1db8abe00a2a19a33fcdae5917a93142e5b843bdd7a9dfad8f6285501c09966c", "ja": "野々原さん、お疲れさま。\n……実行委員長さんは大忙しだね。", "zh": "茜小姐，辛苦了。\n……执行委员会长也真是忙得不可开交呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1047_023aka", "source_sha256": "43cdb76722259e8de7c41fa6060076a49f6d0fc2766cb491eb928d6438480ef2", "ja": "ありがとー。でも大丈夫！\n有能な副委員長ちゃんもいるしネ☆", "zh": "谢谢啦——不过没事的！\n而且还有能干的副委员长在呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1048_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "8af07d038d3e695532c51667308c4231357f840271f1890250403791b45d37c1", "ja": "うん。困ったことがあったら、いつでも頼ってね。\n……けど、野々原さんって、本当にすごいね。", "zh": "嗯。如果遇到困难，随时都可以来找我帮忙哦。\n……不过，野野原小姐真的很厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1049_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "b41cb1d0b8ae112ddfbf32d5f4e8ce92213f1affeddc78847958a527245384e0", "ja": "学校以外に、アイドルのお仕事だってあるのに。\n学園祭の実行委員長も引き受けちゃうなんて。", "zh": "明明除了学校的事，还有偶像工作要做。\n居然还接下了学园祭执行委员长的差事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1050_023aka", "source_sha256": "cf63d13b26416cacde2825650ec09c25ce9c818b65cc2d78a8c6301066f2fb77", "ja": "ウニャ？\nいや～、それほどでも……あるけどね！　ニャハ☆", "zh": "呜喵？\n哎呀～也没那么夸张……不过确实挺夸张的！喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1051_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "0b5c14220a6887f1cac17fb3108c527d6ea949f028dad5788556e1d585026924", "ja": "でも、学園祭のステージの準備なんて……\nアイドルのお仕事とは、全然違うでしょ？", "zh": "但是，准备学园祭的舞台什么的……\n和偶像的工作完全不一样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1052_023aka", "source_sha256": "732bfb4ce65d7eb9b378db0fe70b07f240a74e4499e8242747ba69ea24de4e44", "ja": "いやいや、茜ちゃんの劇場も手作り感満載だよ？\n{$P$}ちゃんは人使いが荒いからね！", "zh": "才没有呢，小茜的剧场也是满满的手工感哦？\n毕竟{$P$}使唤起人来可是毫不留情呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1053_023aka", "source_sha256": "76a4dedb8bb02c5f06dc8db0cce4712e5e4377c21642f48b96d36d54e0ba8b58", "ja": "それに茜ちゃん、学校のみんなと何かするのも\nすっごく楽しいし！", "zh": "而且，小茜，和学校里的大家一起做些什么也特别开心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1054_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "88c32bff04bd9bb3f78f5cddddb2d510d100e537c1c998b48af3db6c6dacbe3d", "ja": "そっか。……本当に、すごいな。本物のアイドルになる\nような人は、やっぱり私たちとは全然違うんだね……。", "zh": "原来如此……真的很厉害。能成为真正偶像的人，果然和我们完全不一样呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_086_1055_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "60f4cddc49cb259d1659f240f12d339bdd05ad304a9dd0e7bf74a7dcfcd4d774", "ja": "あっ……やだ、変なこと言ってごめんね！\nさあ、片付けて帰ろう！", "zh": "啊……讨厌，说了奇怪的话，对不起！\n好了，收拾一下回去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
